<LegalLayout title="Content &amp; Moderation Policy" lastUpdated="March 6, 2026">

<h2>Overview</h2>
<p>This policy governs content published through LoonBox's shared platforms: <strong>The Nest</strong> (feather and extension marketplace) and <strong>Tremolo</strong> (music distribution). It does not apply to your local music library or private application data.</p>
<p>Our goal is simple: keep the platforms useful, legal, and respectful.</p>

<h2>The Nest — Feathers &amp; Extensions</h2>

<h3>Submission Requirements</h3>
<p>All feathers and extensions published to The Nest must:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Include a valid manifest with accurate metadata (name, author, description, version)</li>
  <li>Declare all required permissions honestly — no hidden capabilities</li>
  <li>Not contain malware, spyware, cryptocurrency miners, or any malicious code</li>
  <li>Not impersonate official LoonBox features or other developers' work</li>
  <li>Not include hate speech, slurs, or discriminatory content in names, descriptions, or assets</li>
  <li>Respect third-party intellectual property — do not distribute copyrighted assets without authorization</li>
</ul>

<h3>Extension-Specific Rules</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Extensions must operate within their declared permission scope</li>
  <li>Network requests must go only to domains listed in the manifest</li>
  <li>Extensions must not exfiltrate user data beyond what is necessary for their stated function</li>
  <li>Extensions that connect to third-party services must disclose this in their description and include a privacy notice</li>
</ul>

<h3>Feather-Specific Rules</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Feathers must not contain executable code — they are visual themes only</li>
  <li>Feather assets (images, icons) must not contain offensive, illegal, or NSFW content without appropriate labeling</li>
  <li>Feathers that replicate the look of other software (e.g., Winamp skins) must note this is a tribute/homage, not an official product</li>
</ul>

<h2>Tremolo — Music Distribution</h2>

<h3>Content Requirements</h3>
<p>All music distributed through Tremolo must be:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Legally authorized</strong> — you must own the rights or have explicit permission from the rights holder</li>
  <li><strong>Original or properly licensed</strong> — covers and remixes require appropriate licenses</li>
  <li><strong>Accurately described</strong> — correct artist, title, and metadata</li>
</ul>

<h3>Prohibited Content on Tremolo</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Pirated or unauthorized copies of copyrighted music</li>
  <li>AI-generated content misrepresented as human-created</li>
  <li>Content that incites violence or promotes hate against protected groups</li>
  <li>Content that exploits minors in any way</li>
</ul>

<h3>Rights Holder Takedowns</h3>
<p>We respond to valid DMCA takedown requests. If you believe your copyrighted work has been distributed on Tremolo without authorization, contact <a href="mailto:legal@loonbox.app">legal@loonbox.app</a> with:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Identification of the copyrighted work</li>
  <li>The Tremolo URL or content identifier</li>
  <li>Your contact information and a statement of good faith</li>
</ul>

<h2>Social Features</h2>
<p>When using LoonBox's social features (profiles, playlist sharing, activity feeds, comments), you agree not to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Harass, threaten, or abuse other users</li>
  <li>Post hate speech, slurs, or discriminatory content</li>
  <li>Spam or engage in coordinated inauthentic behavior</li>
  <li>Impersonate other users or public figures</li>
  <li>Share others' private information (doxxing)</li>
</ul>

<h2>Review Process</h2>

<h3>The Nest</h3>
<p>Extensions and feathers submitted to The Nest undergo review before publication:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Automated scan</strong> — manifest validation, permission analysis, known-malware signature check</li>
  <li><strong>Manual review</strong> — for first submissions and flagged content</li>
</ul>
<p>Review typically completes within 48 hours. We may request changes before approving a submission.</p>

<h3>Tremolo</h3>
<p>Tremolo content is reviewed for rights verification before becoming available for purchase. Artists may be asked to provide proof of ownership for disputed content.</p>

<h2>Enforcement</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Severity</th><th>Action</th><th>Examples</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Low</td><td>Content flagged, changes requested</td><td>Missing manifest fields, inaccurate description</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Medium</td><td>Content removed + warning</td><td>Copyright violation, misleading permissions</td></tr>
    <tr><td>High</td><td>Content removed + account suspension</td><td>Repeated violations, data exfiltration</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Severe</td><td>Permanent ban, content purged</td><td>Malware, illegal content, CSAM</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p><strong>CSAM and exploitation:</strong> Any content involving the sexual exploitation of minors results in immediate permanent ban and reporting to NCMEC and relevant law enforcement. There are no warnings or appeals for this category.</p>

<h2>Appeals</h2>
<p>All enforcement actions except severe violations are appealable. To appeal:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Email <a href="mailto:appeals@loonbox.app">appeals@loonbox.app</a> with your account and the action you're contesting</li>
  <li>Appeals are reviewed by a different team member than the original decision</li>
  <li>You will receive a response within 7 business days</li>
</ul>

<h2>Reporting</h2>
<p>To report content that violates this policy:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>In-app:</strong> Use the report button on any Nest listing, Tremolo release, or user profile</li>
  <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:safety@loonbox.app">safety@loonbox.app</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Safety &amp; moderation:</strong> <a href="mailto:safety@loonbox.app">safety@loonbox.app</a></li>
  <li><strong>Copyright / DMCA:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@loonbox.app">legal@loonbox.app</a></li>
  <li><strong>Appeals:</strong> <a href="mailto:appeals@loonbox.app">appeals@loonbox.app</a></li>
</ul>

</LegalLayout>
